# Function App URL from Azure Portal (Overview → URL)
@baseUrl = https://devpipelinemanagmentservice-hqa9f5b0b7b4hqgg.eastus2-01.azurewebsites.net
@token = Bearer <YOUR_FUNCTION_KEY>

### Smoke test (GET — expects 405)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Router
Authorization: {{token}}

###

### LoadSpecialtyData
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Router
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ChatHealthyTask": "LoadSpecialtyData"
}

###

### LoadProviderData — full run (50 workers); for dev add: "max_bytes": 50000000, "num_workers": 10
# @name startProviderLoad
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Router
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

# dev only: "max_bytes": 50000000, "num_workers": 10
{
    "ChatHealthyTask": "LoadProviderData",
    "payload": {
        "num_workers": 50,
        "batch_size": 500,
        "blob_container": "provider-data"
    }
}

###

### LoadProviderData — check status (auto-uses instance_id from the POST above)
GET {{startProviderLoad.response.body.$.statusQueryGetUri}}

###

### LoadProviderData — check status for instance 5e802309 (fired via curl 2026-03-19 20:32 UTC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/runtime/webhooks/durabletask/instances/5e802309caa249ebb36f6bcdb148822c?taskHub=DevPipelineManagmentService&connection=Storage&code=<DURABLE_TASK_CODE>

###
